\paragraph{Direct evidence for a shared cross-lingual subspace.}
A language identity probe trained on conflict task activations transfers to XNLI with $\geq 0.96$ accuracy across all three models ($\geq 0.98$ in the reverse direction), confirming a common representational subspace; at Llama L13, transfer is 0.998.

